  BrickText: {fileID: 5185698447216421960}
  BrickLines:
  - Up! Up!
  - Home please. Want to go home.
  - Up big tower! Not forever, just long time.
  - "Don\u2019t fall! I would miss friend."
  - Friend is so fast. Friend is the best!
  - Shadows coming, shadows bad!
  targetedLines:
  - Shade nice. Shade lost like you!
  - I help! Down please.
  - I make path!
  - Hello? Friend still there?
  - Is Friend shade now?
  - Oopsies.
  - Test 7
